  "readmeFile": "docs/README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Patch notes for 154.0.181\n\nThese patch notes summarize the changes from version 153.2.193.\n\nAdded 11 new endpoints:\n* Meetings.GetMeetings\n* Npt.GetNpts\n* NptStatus.CreateNptTaskStatus\n* NptStatus.UpdateNptTaskStatus\n* NptStatus.DeleteNptTaskStatus\n* Risk.CreateProjectRisk\n* Security.ListBusinessRoles\n* Security.CreateBusinessRole\n* Security.UpdateBusinessRole\n* Security.DeleteBusinessRole\n* Security.ResendEmailValidation\n\nChanges to existing endpoints:\n* ResourceSkill.UpdateResourceSkill added path parameter `resourceSkillId`\n* ResourceSkill.UpdateResourceSkill removed path parameter `skillId`\n* ResourceTeam.UpdateResourceTeam added path parameter `resourceTeamId`\n* ResourceTeam.UpdateResourceTeam removed path parameter `teamresourceId`\n* TaskStatus.UpdateTaskStatus added path parameter `taskStatusId`\n* TaskStatus.UpdateTaskStatus removed path parameter `projectId`\n* TaskStatus.DeleteTaskStatus removed path parameter `projectId`\n\nChanges to data models:\n* TaskDetailsDto: Changed the data type of the field `fieldValues` from `TaskFieldValueDto` to `SimpleTaskFieldValueDto`\n* TaskDto: Changed the data type of the field `fieldValues` from `TaskFieldValueDto` to `SimpleTaskFieldValueDto`\n* TaskStatusUpdateDto: Removed field `id`\n\nDeprecated 1 old endpoints:\n* Risk.CreateRisk",
